{"original":"I left my yellow umbrella on the third hook beside the door. One spoke is bent, so it never folds quite flat.

I made tea in the cracked blue cup. I turn the crack toward the wall so I do not have to look at it. The spare key is still under the sugar tin.

I put a folded towel under the drips before bed.","history":[]}

